ontextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0078","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"太子珍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m045-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p054","text":"昭王病甚，乃召諸公子大夫曰：「孤不佞，再辱楚國之師，今乃得以天壽終，孤之幸也。」讓其弟公子申爲王，不可。又讓次弟公子結，亦不可。乃又讓次弟公子閭，五讓，乃後許爲王。將戰，庚寅，昭王卒於軍中。子閭曰：「王病甚，捨其子讓群臣，臣所以許王，以廣王意也。今君王卒，臣豈敢忘君王之意乎！」乃與子西、子綦謀，伏師閉涂，迎越女之子章立之，是爲惠王。然後罷兵歸，葬昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"公子申","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001937","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"此王為讓位／答應為王的提議用語，不是昭王的指代；未由提議作實際即位、授予或身份用稱。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"公子結","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001938","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"公子閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001939","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"此王為讓位／答應為王的提議用語，不是昭王的指代；未由提議作實際即位、授予或身份用稱。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-008